      "side": 1,
      "message": "tempest.api.volume.* covers volume lifecycle (create/snapshot/backup/...), but instance-level attach coverage (tempest.api.compute.volumes.test_attach_volume) still only exists in the non-voting monolithic job. If excluding it here is deliberate - those tests boot servers and need the tenant-network route, like the excluded ssh-requiring tests - a one-line comment saying so would prevent it being read as an oversight when someone audits the split.",
      "revId": "48caa646acc5394af7e0364d4d3cc07fdb0df87a",
