      "writtenOn": "2026-11-10T07:16:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since this job is now voting: as written, a nova-ironic that stays blocked (\"service not ready\") forever still passes the suite - the accepted-status list plus per-status regex makes the gate pass on the not-converged outcome. That\u0027s clearly documented as intentional, but consider making the accepted outcome visible: e.g. log which of blocked/waiting/active was observed at the end of the configure phase, so a green vote that accepted a blocked nova-ironic is distinguishable in CI history. Alternatively a follow-up non-voting job could require active once the 8vCPU capacity issue is resolved.",
      "revId": "48caa646acc5394af7e0364d4d3cc07fdb0df87a",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543"
    },
